From 023a8ba53c8abd8c1284b2701f1942f90cd08cbb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tangelo Dev <tangelo-dev@noreply.invalid>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 18:48:02 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] httplib: no body after 304 Not Modified

Every SpotPass file the server answered with 304 (not changed since the last download) failed
after exactly 5 seconds with "Request failed: 4: Failed to read connection" (Hans: Badge
Arcade data_v131.dat each start; Eric 18 Oct: EU_BGM1, news_v131.dat, dstdatList.bin,
tournament, extdata). nginx sends the 304 without Content-Length on a kept-alive connection
(the console asks for keep-alive), and httplib 0.14 then read the "body" until the connection
closed, which only ended with its 5 s read timeout. 304 and 1xx answers have no body.

Reproduced and checked with a keep-alive request to a server answering 304: before, error 4
after 5.01 s; after, status 304 at once.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FYz3krf43qKGY6aS2Z5snz
---
 BUILD-NUMBER                | 2 +-
 externals/httplib/httplib.h | 7 ++++++-
 2 files changed, 7 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/BUILD-NUMBER b/BUILD-NUMBER
index 190a18037..fc902f4f9 100644
--- a/BUILD-NUMBER
+++ b/BUILD-NUMBER
@@ -1 +1 @@
-123
+124
diff --git a/externals/httplib/httplib.h b/externals/httplib/httplib.h
index 4073afcab..716919964 100644
--- a/externals/httplib/httplib.h
+++ b/externals/httplib/httplib.h
@@ -7293,7 +7293,12 @@ inline bool ClientImpl::process_request(Stream &strm, Request &req,
   }
 
   // Body
-  if ((res.status != 204) && req.method != "HEAD" && req.method != "CONNECT") {
+  // Tangelo: 304 Not Modified (and 1xx) never carry a body. nginx sends a 304 without
+  // Content-Length on a kept-alive connection, so reading "until the connection closes" waited
+  // for the 5 s read timeout and turned every SpotPass "not modified" into Error::Read.
+  if ((res.status != 204) && (res.status != 304) &&
+      !(res.status >= 100 && res.status < 200) && req.method != "HEAD" &&
+      req.method != "CONNECT") {
     auto redirect = 300 < res.status && res.status < 400 && follow_location_;
 
     if (req.response_handler && !redirect) {
